al-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e伊涅芙\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e饰金之梦四件套效果提供的元素精通与攻击力加成可提升伊涅芙的输出能力和护盾强度。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"4148\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/05/10/4328207/33c41932d1b5531ac73bca243c761816_9206912725698153960.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"久岐忍\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4148/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4148/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/05/10/4328207/33c41932d1b5531ac73bca243c761816_9206912725698153960.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e久岐忍\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2606\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/02/16314655/f4b404cae89b96327a5b87500f7833c9_6577116317420146203.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"托马\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2606/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2606/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/02/16314655/f4b404cae89b